  triage:title "Unix TCP transport silently drops over-capacity connection without typed rejection" ;
  triage:description "local_tcp_transport.rs:109-133 (Unix serve_until_terminated) silently drops accepted connection at capacity (Ok(_) => {}, no response) instead of using typed-rejection pattern (AtmErrorCode::DaemonConnectionSaturated) already established on sibling Unix UDS transport (local_ipc_transport/accept_loop.rs:107-157)." ;
